menu "BlueAudio Puck: remote control"

    config PUCK_DEFAULT_VOLUME
        int "Volume at power-on (0-127)"
        default 96
        range 0 127
        help
            AVRCP absolute volume applied before a source connects. Most
            sources push their own value shortly after connecting, so this only
            governs the first moment of playback. 96 is about 75%.

endmenu
